# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PyInstaller
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Everything PyInstaller produces is treated as a build artifact, including the
# generated `*.spec` (it records absolute local paths and is recreated on every
# build).  `dist/` also holds the release ZIP, which is uploaded as a GitHub
# release asset instead of being committed.
*.spec
*.manifest

